{"seq":1,"slug":"completion","title":"代码补全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/language-features/completion","wordCount":1167,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码补全\">代码补全</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>补全的本质是一次「<strong>在光标处预测用户想输入什么</strong>」的请求。它之所以是语言特性中最复杂的一个，是因为它同时要满足两个矛盾的目标：<strong>快</strong>（按键即触发，必须在百毫秒内返回）和 <strong>全</strong>（要附带文档、类型、自动导入等丰富信息）。LSP 用两个设计化解这个矛盾：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发机制</td>\n<td>决定何时发起请求（手动/触发字符/续发）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Resolve 懒加载</td>\n<td>先返回轻量列表，选中后再补详情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CompletionItem</td>\n<td>承载呈现、排序、插入所需的全部字段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>理解补全的关键在于分清「客户端负责的排序与过滤」和「服务端负责的候选与详情」——<code>sortText</code>/<code>filterText</code> 就是这两者之间的契约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"补全触发机制\">补全触发机制</h2><p>代码补全是编辑器中使用频率最高的语言特性。LSP 通过 <code>textDocument/completion</code> 请求实现，支持多种触发方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CompletionParams {&#10;  textDocument: TextDocumentIdentifier;&#10;  position: Position;&#10;  context?: CompletionContext;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CompletionContext {&#10;  triggerKind: CompletionTriggerKind;&#10;  triggerCharacter?: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;enum CompletionTriggerKind {&#10;  Invoked = 1,&#10;  TriggerCharacter = 2,&#10;  TriggerForIncompleteCompletions = 3,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompletionParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  textDocument</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextDocumentIdentifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompletionContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompletionContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  triggerKind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompletionTriggerKind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  triggerCharacter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompletionTriggerKind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  Invoked</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  TriggerCharacter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  TriggerForIncompleteCompletions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 用户&#10;    participant E as 编辑器&#10;    participant S as 语言服务器&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;E: 输入 &quot;.&quot;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/completion (trigger: &quot;.&quot;)&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: 分析上下文,查找成员&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;E: CompletionList&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;U: 显示补全菜单&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;E: 选择补全项&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: completionItem/resolve&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;E: 完整的补全项(含文档和额外编辑)&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;E: 应用补全\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户\n    participant E as 编辑器\n    participant S as 语言服务器\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;E: 输入 \".\"\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/completion (trigger: \".\")\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: 分析上下文,查找成员\n    S--&gt;&gt;E: CompletionList\n    E-&gt;&gt;U: 显示补全菜单\n    U-&gt;&gt;E: 选择补全项\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: completionItem/resolve\n    S--&gt;&gt;E: 完整的补全项(含文档和额外编辑)\n    E-&gt;&gt;E: 应用补全</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n<th>triggerKind</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手动触发</td>\n<td>1 (Invoked)</td>\n<td>用户按 Ctrl+Space 等快捷键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发字符</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>输入 <code>.</code>、<code>/</code>、<code>&lt;</code> 等配置的触发字符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不完整补全续发</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>上次结果标记为 isIncomplete 时继续请求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>服务端声明补全能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const capabilities: ServerCapabilities = {&#10;  completionProvider: {&#10;    triggerCharacters: [&#39;.&#39;, &#39;/&#39;, &#39;&lt;&#39;, &#39;&quot;&#39;, &quot;&#39;&quot;, &#39;@&#39;],&#10;    resolveProvider: true,&#10;    workDoneProgress: true,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> capabilities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServerCapabilities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  completionProvider: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    triggerCharacters: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'\"'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"'\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    resolveProvider: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    workDoneProgress: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>triggerCharacters</code> 应精简，过多的触发字符会导致用户输入时频繁弹出补全菜单，影响体验。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"completionitem-结构\">CompletionItem 结构</h2><p>每个补全项包含丰富的元信息，用于呈现和应用补全。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CompletionItem {&#10;  label: string;&#10;  labelDetails?: CompletionItemLabelDetails;&#10;  kind?: CompletionItemKind;&#10;  detail?: string;&#10;  documentation?: string | MarkupContent;&#10;  preselect?: boolean;&#10;  sortText?: string;&#10;  filterText?: string;&#10;  insertText?: string;&#10;  insertTextFormat?: InsertTextFormat;&#10;  textEdit?: TextEdit | InsertReplaceEdit;&#10;  additionalTextEdits?: TextEdit[];&#10;  commitCharacters?: string[];&#10;  command?: Command;&#10;  data?: unknown;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompletionItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  labelDetails</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompletionItemLabelDetails</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompletionItemKind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  detail</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  documentation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MarkupContent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  preselect</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sortText</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  filterText</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  insertText</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  insertTextFormat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InsertTextFormat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  textEdit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextEdit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InsertReplaceEdit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  additionalTextEdits</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextEdit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  commitCharacters</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  command</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键字段的作用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>label</td>\n<td>补全菜单中显示的文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kind</td>\n<td>图标类型（函数、变量、类等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sortText</td>\n<td>排序键（不同于 label 的排序规则）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>filterText</td>\n<td>过滤键（用户继续输入时的匹配依据）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>insertText</td>\n<td>实际插入的文本（可与 label 不同）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>textEdit</td>\n<td>精确的编辑范围和文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>additionalTextEdits</td>\n<td>附带的额外编辑（如自动导入语句）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>data</td>\n<td>服务端自定义数据，用于 resolve 阶段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"resolve-懒加载\">Resolve 懒加载</h2><p>计算所有补全项的完整信息（如文档注释、自动导入）成本很高。LSP 支持分两阶段返回补全项。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"connection.onCompletion((params): CompletionItem[] =&gt; {&#10;  return [&#10;    {&#10;      label: &#39;useState&#39;,&#10;      kind: CompletionItemKind.Function,&#10;      sortText: &#39;0001&#39;,&#10;      data: { source: &#39;react&#39;, exportName: &#39;useState&#39; },&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      label: &#39;useEffect&#39;,&#10;      kind: CompletionItemKind.Function,&#10;      sortText: &#39;0002&#39;,&#10;      data: { source: &#39;react&#39;, exportName: &#39;useEffect&#39; },&#10;    },&#10;  ];&#10;});&#10;&#10;connection.onCompletionResolve((item): CompletionItem =&gt; {&#10;  const { source, exportName } = item.data as { source: string; exportName: string };&#10;  item.documentation = { kind: &#39;markdown&#39;, value: getDocumentation(source, exportName) };&#10;  item.additionalTextEdits = [&#10;    {&#10;      range: { start: { line: 0, character: 0 }, end: { line: 0, character: 0 } },&#10;      newText: `import { ${exportName} } from &#39;${source}&#39;;\\n`,&#10;    },&#10;  ];&#10;  return item;&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">connection.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onCompletion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompletionItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      label: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'useState'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      kind: CompletionItemKind.Function,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 