<span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  Snippet</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;label&quot;: &quot;for loop&quot;,&#10;  &quot;insertTextFormat&quot;: 2,&#10;  &quot;insertText&quot;: &quot;for (let ${1:i} = 0; $1 &lt; ${2:array}.length; $1++) {\\n\\t$0\\n}&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"for loop\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"insertTextFormat\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"insertText\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"for (let ${1:i} = 0; $1 &#x3C; ${2:array}.length; $1++) {</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n\\t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Snippet 语法要素：</p>\n<p>| 语法                                | 说明                 | 示例                 |\n| ----------------------------------- | -------------------- | -------------------- | -------- | ---- | ------------- | --- |\n| <code>$1</code>、<code>$2</code>                          | Tab stop（跳转顺序） | <code>func($1, $2)</code>       |\n| <code>$0</code>                                | 最终光标位置         | <code>if ($1) {\\n\\t$0\\n}</code> |\n| <code>${1:placeholder}</code>                  | 带默认值的占位符     | <code>${1:name}</code>          |\n| <code>${1                                | one,two,three        | }</code>                   | 选择列表 | <code>${1 | const,let,var | }</code>  |\n| <code>$TM_FILENAME</code>                      | 内置变量             | 当前文件名           |\n| <code>${TM_FILENAME/(.*)/${1:/upcase}/}</code> | 变量变换             | 文件名转大写         |</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    SNIPPET[&quot;for (let ${1:i} = 0; ...&quot;] --&gt; TAB1[&quot;Tab → 选中 i&quot;]&#10;    TAB1 --&gt; TAB2[&quot;Tab → 选中 array&quot;]&#10;    TAB2 --&gt; TAB3[&quot;Tab → 光标到循环体&quot;]\">graph LR\n    SNIPPET[\"for (let ${1:i} = 0; ...\"] --&gt; TAB1[\"Tab → 选中 i\"]\n    TAB1 --&gt; TAB2[\"Tab → 选中 array\"]\n    TAB2 --&gt; TAB3[\"Tab → 光标到循环体\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> snippet 中的 <code>$</code> 和 <code>}</code> 是特殊字符，如需插入字面量需要用 <code>\\$</code> 和 <code>\\}</code> 转义。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"排序与过滤\">排序与过滤</h2><p>客户端根据 <code>sortText</code> 和 <code>filterText</code> 对补全项进行排序和过滤，服务端可以精确控制排序优先级。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function createCompletionItems(): CompletionItem[] {&#10;  return [&#10;    {&#10;      label: &#39;console.log&#39;,&#10;      sortText: &#39;0000_console.log&#39;,&#10;      filterText: &#39;console.log log cl&#39;,&#10;      kind: CompletionItemKind.Method,&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      label: &#39;console.error&#39;,&#10;      sortText: &#39;0001_console.error&#39;,&#10;      filterText: &#39;console.error error ce&#39;,&#10;      kind: CompletionItemKind.Method,&#10;    },&#10;    { label: &#39;const&#39;, sortText: &#39;0010_const&#39;, kind: CompletionItemKind.Keyword },&#10;  ];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createCompletionItems</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CompletionItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      label: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'console.log'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      sortText: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0000_console.log'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      filterText: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'console.log log cl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      kind: CompletionItemKind.Method,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      label: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'console.error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      sortText: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0001_console.error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      filterText: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'console.error error ce'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      kind: CompletionItemKind.Method,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { label: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'const'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, sortText: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0010_const'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, kind: CompletionItemKind.Keyword },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>sortText</td>\n<td>= label</td>\n<td>决定补全列表中的排序位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>filterText</td>\n<td>= label</td>\n<td>用户输入时用于模糊匹配的文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>preselect</td>\n<td>false</td>\n<td>是否默认选中此项</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>排序优先级策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>sortText 前缀</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td><code>0000_</code></td>\n<td>最常用的 API、上下文相关推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td><code>0001_</code></td>\n<td>当前作用域内的局部变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中</td>\n<td><code>0010_</code></td>\n<td>导入的模块成员</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td><code>0100_</code></td>\n<td>关键字、全局对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td><code>1000_</code></td>\n<td>不常用的补全项</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自动导入与-commit-字符\">自动导入与 Commit 字符</h2><p>自动导入通过 <code>additionalTextEdits</code> 实现，在补全应用时自动插入 import 语句。Commit 字符允许用户通过特定字符一键确认补全。const completionItem: CompletionItem = { label: &#39;useState&#39;, kind: CompletionItemKind.Function, commitCharacters: [&#39;(&#39;, &#39;.&#39;], additionalTextEdits: [ { range: { start: { line: 2, character: 0 }, end: { line: 2, character: 0 } }, newText: &quot;import { useState } from &#39;react&#39;;\\n&quot; } ] };</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&#10;```mermaid&#10;sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 用户&#10;    participant E as 编辑器&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;E: 输入 &quot;useSt&quot;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;E: 显示补全：useState&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;E: 输入 &quot;(&quot; (commit 字符)&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;E: 确认 useState 补全&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;E: 插入 &quot;useState(&quot;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;E: 在文件顶部插入 import 语句\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>```mermaid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sequenceDiagram</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    participant U as 用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    participant E as 编辑器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    U->>E: 输入 \"useSt\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    E->>E: 显示补全：useState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    U->>E: 输入 \"(\" (commit 字符)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    E->>E: 确认 useState 补全</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    E->>E: 插入 \"useState(\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    E->>E: 在文件顶部插入 import 语句</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>commitCharacters</td>\n<td>输入这些字符时自动确认当前高亮的补全项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常用 commit 字符</td>\n<td><code>(</code>、<code>.</code>、<code>;</code>、<code>,</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>additionalTextEdits</td>\n<td>补全确认后执行的额外编辑（同步应用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动导入位置</td>\n<td>通常在文件头部的 import 区域</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>additionalTextEdits</code> 应在 <code>completionItem/resolve</code> 阶段计算，避免为所有补全项预先计算导入路径。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((代码补全))&#10;    触发机制&#10;      手动触发 Ctrl+Space&#10;      触发字符 &quot;. / &lt;&quot;&#10;      不完整续发&#10;    CompletionItem&#10;      label / kind / detail&#10;      sortText / filterText&#10;      insertText / textEdit&#10;    Resolve 懒加载&#10;      初始返回轻量信息&#10;      选中时加载完整详情&#10;      两阶段 &lt; 300ms&#10;    Snippet 语法&#10;      Tab stop 跳转&#10;      占位符与选择&#10;      变量与变换&#10;    排序与自动导入&#10;      sortText 控制优先级&#10;      commitCharacters 快捷确认&#10;      additionalTextEdits 自动导入\">mindmap\n  root((代码补全))\n    触发机制\n      手动触发 Ctrl+Space\n      触发字符 \". / &lt;\"\n      不完整续发\n    CompletionItem\n      label / kind / detail\n      sortText / filterText\n      insertText / textEdit\n    Resolve 懒加载\n      初始返回轻量信息\n      选中时加载完整详情\n      两阶段 &lt; 300ms\n    Snippet 语法\n      Tab stop 跳转\n      占位符与选择\n      变量与变换\n    排序与自动导入\n      sortText 控制优先级\n      commitCharacters 快捷确认\n      additionalTextEdits 自动导入</pre><ul>\n<li>补全触发支持<strong>手动调用</strong>、<strong>触发字符</strong>和<strong>不完整续发</strong>三种模式。</li>\n<li><strong>CompletionItem</strong> 包含丰富的元信息，通过 sortText/filterText 控制排序和过滤行为。</li>\n<li><strong>Resolve 懒加载</strong>将补全分为两阶段，初始请求快速返回列表，选中时按需加载文档和额外编辑。</li>\n<li>LSP 的 <strong>snippet 语法</strong>支持 Tab stop、占位符、选择列表和变量变换。</li>\n<li><strong>自动导入</strong>通过 additionalTextEdits 实现，<strong>commit 字符</strong>允许用户输入特定字符时一键确认补全。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代码补全","id":"代码补全"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"补全触发机制","id":"补全触发机制"},{"level":2,"text":"CompletionItem 结构","id":"completionitem-结构"},{"level":2,"text":"Resolve 懒加载","id":"resolve-懒加载"},{"level":2,"text":"Snippet 语法","id":"snippet-语法"},{"level":2,"text":"排序与过滤","id":"排序与过滤"},{"level":2,"text":"自动导入与 Commit 字符","id":"自动导入与-commit-字符"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"工作区管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/lsp-specification/workspace-management"},"next":{"title":"诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/language-features/diagnostics"}}